### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3500
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 1. Root / Frontend Page
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 2. Register New User
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "user": "testadmin",
    "pwd": "Password123!"
}

### 3. Login User (Obtains Access Token + sets Refresh Token Cookie)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "user": "testadmin",
    "pwd": "Password123!"
}

### Register New Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "user": "superadmin",
    "pwd": "Password123!",
    "roles": { "User": 2001, "Editor": 1984, "Admin": 5150 }
}

### 4. Refresh Token (Uses Cookie)
# @name refresh
GET {{baseUrl}}/refresh

### 5. Get All Employees (Protected - Requires Access Token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. Create New Employee (Requires Editor or Admin role)
# @name createEmployee
POST {{baseUrl}}/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstname": "Jane",
    "lastname": "Smith"
}

### 7. Update Employee
PUT {{baseUrl}}/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": "{{createEmployee.response.body._id}}",
    "firstname": "Janet",
    "lastname": "Smith-Johnson"
}

### 8. Get Single Employee by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/{{createEmployee.response.body._id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 9. Delete Employee (Requires Admin role)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": "{{createEmployee.response.body._id}}"
}

### 10. Get All Registered Users (Admin only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 11. Logout (Clears Refresh Token Cookie)
GET {{baseUrl}}/logout
